#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:1 6f4ef84c39fe45a988887d9bba5b75d4
msgid "配置系统"
msgstr "Configuration system"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:3 ed18908917474076a6897a76a2277703
msgid "UniKT 的命令行参数由多个预定义配置类统一管理，同时支持每个模型通过装饰器注册自己的专属参数。本页介绍如何查看、使用和扩展这些参数。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT's CLI arguments are managed centrally by several predefined "
"configuration classes, while each model can register its own dedicated "
"parameters via a decorator. This page describes how to view, use, and "
"extend these parameters."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:5 90a4bcb185a940019a85354721232456
msgid "查看可用参数"
msgstr "View available parameters"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:7 3834f31cc1d0489b9725137794e4cec4
msgid "训练脚本支持分层参数解析：先加载通用参数，再按 ``-m`` 指定的模型注入模型专属参数。在模型名后加 ``-h`` 即可看到完整的参数列表："
msgstr ""
"The training script supports layered argument parsing: general parameters "
"are loaded first, then model-specific parameters are injected based on the "
"model specified by ``-m``. Append ``-h`` after the model name to see the "
"full parameter list:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:13 108e4f8a67084f4aa18ef4513aff8bdd
msgid ""
"输出会按参数组分类，依次显示 General Parameters、Data Parameters、Early Stopping "
"Parameters、Compile Parameters 和 GIKT Parameters。直接运行 ``python train.py "
"-h`` 则只显示通用参数组。"
msgstr ""
"The output is grouped by category, listing General Parameters, Data "
"Parameters, Early Stopping Parameters, Compile Parameters, and GIKT "
"Parameters in turn. Running ``python train.py -h`` directly shows only the "
"general parameter groups."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:15 41ebde0490c74d7ea93f12c3014ae7a8
msgid "通用参数组"
msgstr "General parameter groups"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:17 881208372dae4299946bc1b9b8383d99
msgid ""
"这些参数在 ``utils/config/param_config.py`` 中定义为 ``BaseParamConfig`` 的子类，由 "
"``train.py`` 无条件加载。"
msgstr ""
"These parameters are defined in ``utils/config/param_config.py`` as "
"subclasses of ``BaseParamConfig`` and are loaded unconditionally by "
"``train.py``."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:21 4e88bc1c657545a3955e49b4eff898d1
msgid "GeneralParams — 运行控制"
msgstr "GeneralParams — Run control"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:23 31272344b8e04301ad9eab7fbefd6908
msgid "控制设备、日志、种子等基础行为："
msgstr "Controls basic behaviors such as device, logging, and seed:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:33 4d26c723a007415ca3cab37d74d9e914
msgid ""
"``--seed`` 用于复现实验，设置为不同值可以测试模型对随机性的敏感度。``--device`` 默认自动检测 GPU 可用性，但在多 "
"GPU 机器上建议显式指定（如 ``cuda:0``）。``--no_swanlab`` 关闭 SwanLab "
"记录，适合本地快速迭代时减少网络开销。"
msgstr ""
"``--seed`` is used to reproduce experiments; setting it to different values "
"lets you test the model's sensitivity to randomness. ``--device`` "
"auto-detects GPU availability by default, but on multi-GPU machines you "
"should specify it explicitly (e.g. ``cuda:0``). ``--no_swanlab`` disables "
"SwanLab logging, which is useful for reducing network overhead during fast "
"local iteration."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:35 5532d4b869844211af3bce723bfa5825
msgid ""
"**注意：** ``--deterministic`` 默认开启（``True``），会调用 "
"``torch.use_deterministic_algorithms`` 确保可复现性。若某个算子不支持 deterministic "
"模式导致训练失败，可以用 ``--no-deterministic`` 关闭。"
msgstr ""
"**Note:** ``--deterministic`` is enabled by default (``True``) and calls "
"``torch.use_deterministic_algorithms`` to ensure reproducibility. If a "
"particular operator does not support deterministic mode and causes training "
"to fail, disable it with ``--no-deterministic``."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:39 f1d61ec3cc5341bfa6cd81be4cc6fd8e
msgid "DataParams — 数据加载"
msgstr "DataParams — Data loading"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:49 7cbcddc6488345f9b28142f95983889a
msgid ""
"``--dataset`` / ``-d`` 是必选参数，可选值包括 "
"``algebra2005``、``algebra2006``、``assistments09``、``assistments12``、``assistments15``、``assistments17``、``bridge2006``、``ednet_kt1``、``junyi2015``、``nips2020_t34``、``slepemapy``，共"
" 11 个数据集。"
msgstr ""
"``--dataset`` / ``-d`` is a required argument. Valid values are "
"``algebra2005``, ``algebra2006``, ``assistments09``, ``assistments12``, "
"``assistments15``, ``assistments17``, ``bridge2006``, ``ednet_kt1``, "
"``junyi2015``, ``nips2020_t34``, and ``slepemapy`` — 11 datasets in total."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:51 b729a4ded32a4a1bbccba8174733e8e7
msgid ""
"``--fold`` 指定当前使用第几折（0-indexed），与 ``--kfold`` 配合完成 K 折交叉验证。例如 ``--kfold 5"
" --fold 0`` 表示 5 折中的第 1 折。``--test_ratio`` 控制测试集用户占比。测试集用户不参与训练和验证，与 "
"``--kfold`` 同时生效——``test_ratio`` 决定测试集比例，``kfold`` 对剩余数据划分训练/验证折。"
msgstr ""
"``--fold`` specifies which fold to use (0-indexed) and works with "
"``--kfold`` to perform K-fold cross validation. For example, ``--kfold 5 "
"--fold 0`` selects the first of 5 folds. ``--test_ratio`` controls the "
"proportion of users held out for the test set. Test-set users do not "
"participate in training or validation and take effect alongside ``--kfold`` "
"— ``test_ratio`` determines the test-set proportion, and ``kfold`` splits "
"the remaining data into training/validation folds."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:53 c228a7f20402448ead1bf768fc980459
msgid ""
"``--max_seq_len`` 会截断过长的交互序列，减小显存占用。数据集 ``assistments09`` 序列通常较短，设 200 "
"足够；``ednet_kt1`` 序列较长，可适当增大至 500。"
msgstr ""
"``--max_seq_len`` truncates overly long interaction sequences to reduce GPU "
"memory usage. The ``assistments09`` dataset generally has short sequences, "
"so 200 is sufficient; ``ednet_kt1`` has longer sequences and can be "
"increased to around 500."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:57 51171049163f4182971ac3d5cc151446
msgid "EarlyStoppingParams — 早停控制"
msgstr "EarlyStoppingParams — Early stopping control"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:67 2c3de20ad3404ecab6ba74c9ad425a7f
msgid ""
"``--es_monitor`` 指定监控指标，在验证集上计算。分类任务通常用 ``auc``（AUC 越高越好，``--es_mode "
"max``），回归任务用 ``rmse``（越低越好，``--es_mode min``）。``--es_patience`` 设为 0 "
"可以完全禁用早停。"
msgstr ""
"``--es_monitor`` specifies the metric to monitor, computed on the validation "
"set. Classification tasks typically use ``auc`` (higher is better, "
"``--es_mode max``), while regression tasks use ``rmse`` (lower is better, "
"``--es_mode min``). Setting ``--es_patience`` to 0 disables early stopping "
"entirely."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:69 999a48c6812c496aa2bd3ea21a8ed0d2
msgid ""
"``--es_min_delta`` "
"决定\"有改进\"的阈值：只有当前指标与历史最优的差值超过此值，才视为有效改进。面对波动较大的训练曲线时，适当增大此值（如 "
"0.005）可以避免因噪声提前停止。"
msgstr ""
"``--es_min_delta`` sets the threshold for what counts as an \"improvement\": "
"only when the current metric exceeds the historical best by more than this "
"value is it treated as a valid improvement. For noisy training curves, "
"increasing this value (e.g. to 0.005) can prevent premature stopping due "
"to noise."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:71 80b46c0d9e654fb3b67c29e50677feb2
msgid "模型特定参数"
msgstr "Model-specific parameters"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:73 d2d82c325e6f4ae493077cda4d40753d
msgid ""
"每个模型通过 ``@register_model_params`` 装饰器将自己独有的超参数暴露给 CLI。这套机制由三步组成：定义参数类 → "
"注册到全局表 → CLI 自动注入。"
msgstr ""
"Each model exposes its own unique hyperparameters to the CLI via the "
"``@register_model_params`` decorator. This mechanism has three steps: "
"define a parameter class, register it in the global table, then the CLI "
"injects it automatically."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:75 1cbf28fca28e46e38021a66595826340
msgid "如何工作"
msgstr "How it works"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:77 33da94695ac441efab2630582b24abae
msgid "以 GIKT 为例，在 ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` 中："
msgstr "Using GIKT as an example, in ``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:114 dbb82dca7dfc40d5b1d84023f39dabfd
msgid "``define_params`` 返回一个 ``(组名, 参数字典)`` 的元组。参数字典的键是 CLI 参数名，值为配置字典，支持以下字段："
msgstr ""
"``define_params`` returns a ``(group_name, params_dict)`` tuple. The keys of "
"``params_dict`` are CLI argument names and the values are configuration "
"dicts supporting the following fields:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:116 a5d0189f434344659b798a3dc6937ff1
msgid ""
"``type``：参数类型，``int`` / ``float`` / ``str`` / ``bool``。``bool`` 类型会自动转换为 "
"``store_true`` 或 ``store_false`` action"
msgstr ""
"``type``: the argument type, ``int`` / ``float`` / ``str`` / ``bool``. A "
"``bool`` type is automatically converted to a ``store_true`` or "
"``store_false`` action"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:117 3a87539f8ea84f1283ef9bbe867f7180
msgid "``default``：默认值"
msgstr "``default``: the default value"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:118 a9154efac2b14864b06dc9e1cdf1a402
msgid "``short``：短选项名（如 ``\"ed\"`` → ``-ed``）"
msgstr "``short``: the short option name (e.g. ``\"ed\"`` → ``-ed``)"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:119 d915e02b8b164a8f9ceb376e5aa63260
msgid "``help``：帮助文本"
msgstr "``help``: the help text"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:120 a4df817624254c4ca97c6a71c88da6f8
msgid "``choices``：可选值列表（用于 ``str`` 类型）"
msgstr "``choices``: the list of allowed values (for the ``str`` type)"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:122 51ef2be322f94b8f8fe8cff55174a474
msgid ""
"注册到全局表 ``PARAM_CONFIGS`` 后，``train.py`` 在解析参数时会调用 "
"``get_model_params(\"GIKT\").add_args(parser)``，将这些参数注入到 ArgumentParser "
"中。"
msgstr ""
"Once registered in the global ``PARAM_CONFIGS`` table, ``train.py`` calls "
"``get_model_params(\"GIKT\").add_args(parser)`` during argument parsing to "
"inject these parameters into the ArgumentParser."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:124 9bf9b222853947d493a8380e81976ed1
msgid "使用模型参数"
msgstr "Using model parameters"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:126 9d17a267d1b34d81ba3d70796910fbe2
msgid "注册后即可像通用参数一样在命令行中使用："
msgstr ""
"Once registered, they can be used on the command line just like the general "
"parameters:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:136 f01b0d2845224248a8669005975279b8
msgid ""
"GIKT 特有的参数如 "
"``--skill_neighbor_num``（每跳技能邻居采样数）、``--hist_neighbor_num``（同技能历史邻居数 "
"M）只在使用 GIKT 模型时出现，切换到其他模型会显示不同的专属参数集。"
msgstr ""
"GIKT-specific arguments such as ``--skill_neighbor_num`` (number of skill "
"neighbors sampled per hop) and ``--hist_neighbor_num`` (number M of "
"same-skill historical neighbors) appear only when using the GIKT model; "
"switching to another model displays a different set of dedicated parameters."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:138 340385ca475e4f57bf30811d670c7c6d
msgid "为新模型添加参数"
msgstr "Adding parameters for a new model"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:140 af80758289b5464c90a02fcd18b7b771
msgid "如果你在添加一个新模型，按三步完成参数集成："
msgstr "If you are adding a new model, complete parameter integration in three steps:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:142 59e1d893eb02489bb82af237886acfb8
msgid "**1. 定义参数类**（在 ``model/YourModel/YourModel_trainer.py``）："
msgstr ""
"**1. Define the parameter class** (in "
"``model/YourModel/YourModel_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:158 55a17d26488949b1a6e77a9b8ac4fe83
msgid ""
"**2. 注册**：装饰器 ``@register_model_params(\"YourModel\")`` "
"已完成注册。**注意**：装饰器参数必须是字符串字面量，不能使用变量或表达式，否则 AST "
"静态发现（``utils/core/discovery.py``）无法识别。"
msgstr ""
"**2. Register**: the ``@register_model_params(\"YourModel\")`` decorator "
"handles registration. **Note**: the decorator argument must be a string "
"literal; variables or expressions are not accepted, otherwise AST-based "
"static discovery (``utils/core/discovery.py``) cannot recognize it."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:160 e61cf2ed1d6d4362a3a9fe8f45d4b8a4
msgid "**3. 配置使用**：完成定义后无需任何额外步骤，``train.py`` 会自动发现并加载。最终用法与其他模型一致："
msgstr ""
"**3. Use it**: once defined, no extra steps are required — ``train.py`` "
"discovers and loads it automatically. The final usage matches other models:"

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:166 d35e9188883e44a7b04f7d22f86ebe7a
msgid ""
"**注意**：若无法通过 ``-h`` 看到新参数，检查装饰器参数是否为字符串字面量，且文件位于 ``model/`` "
"目录下（静态发现只扫描该目录）。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**: if the new parameters do not appear via ``-h``, verify that the "
"decorator argument is a string literal and that the file is under the "
"``model/`` directory (static discovery only scans that directory)."

#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:168 474bafd00e4341acb6f14a2f079c795c
