#: ../../source/advanced/config.md:190 f72e8f7fcd734ce89d6080de842a3b55
msgid ""
"代码中通过 ``dotenv.load_dotenv`` 自动加载。**注意**：SwanLab 需要在首次使用前完成登录认证，在终端执行 "
"``swanlab login`` 获取 API 密钥。``--no_swanlab`` 或 ``--nsl`` 标志可以完全关闭 SwanLab"
" 后端，只保留本地 CSV 记录。"
msgstr ""
"It is loaded automatically in the code via ``dotenv.load_dotenv``. **Note**: "
"SwanLab requires authentication before first use — run ``swanlab login`` in "
"the terminal to obtain an API key. The ``--no_swanlab`` or ``--nsl`` flag "
"disables the SwanLab backend entirely, keeping only local CSV logging."
